            "review_text": "trung đức\nQuang Binh Province, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\n#haisan\nJul 2026 • Family\nI just had the opportunity to visit this seafood restaurant and feel quite positive. Clean space, airy layout, there is a fresh seafood reservoir so guests can choose directly very safe. The staff is quick, friendly, ready to advise appropriate food.\n\nShellfish is the highlight, strong meat, natural sweet. I tried both brewing and baking salt peppers, each with its own taste, thick but not too salty. Also, light fat cheese shrimp, easy to eat, suitable for group travel. Time is fast enough for the restaurant.\n\nThe price is reasonable compared to quality and location. However, the highlights are noisy and you need to book a table in advance for a nice place. Overall, this is a place to try when you want to eat fresh seafood in Da Nang.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 22, 2026",
