            "review_text": "Thu Hà\nDa Nang, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nTravel to Nano\nJul 2026 • Friends\nThis time, I chose a restaurant for lunch and was really happy. Seafood here is delicious, processed hard, any dish is fine. What impresses me most is the reasonable price compared to the quality of the food.\nNot only that, the staff is very enthusiastic, friendly and always happy with the guests. At the end of the meal, the restaurant also offered dessert as a thank you, making me feel very appreciated.\nIf there is a chance to visit Da Nang, I will definitely return to Ku Tom Seafood and would also be happy to recommend the restaurant to friends and relatives. This is a place worth experiencing with delicious food, reasonable prices and careful service.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 22, 2026",
