            "review_text": "Minh Hiếu\nSon Tra Peninsula, Vietnam27 contributions\n0\nCheap and popular seafood\nJul 2026 • Family\nI had dinner with my family at the restaurant and had a very happy experience. The bar space is spacious, clean, the table is arranged neatly so that even though there are quite crowded guests, it creates a comfortable feeling. The staff is agile, enthusiastic and always ready to support when guests need it.\n\nWhat impresses me most is that the seafood is very fresh. Shrimp, crab, ink and other shellfish are prepared orally, keeping the natural sweetness. Food comes up pretty quickly, beautiful presentation, full portion should be suitable for family or group of travelers. Every food is tasteful and everyone in my family is good.\n\nThe price is quite reasonable compared to the quality of food and space. Despite calling many items, the total bill is still very affordable. Parking is convenient, the bar is bright and creates a clean feeling during meals.\n\nIf there is a small point to improve, at peak hours the bar is quite crowded and there is noise. However, this does not affect the overall experience. I will definitely come back with my family and will recommend this place to my friends. If you are looking for a place to enjoy fresh seafood at a reasonable price and good service, this is a great choice to experience. Appreciate this location.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten July 22, 2026",
